{% comment %}
  Adds the product's badge text (custom.product_badge_1) to the add-to-cart form as the
  line item property "Notice". The property is copied onto the order line item, so it prints
  on the cart, checkout, order status page, emails, packing slip and admin order.
  (Packing slips and Shopify-hosted pages cannot read product metafields themselves.)

  Accepts:
  - product_obj: {Object} Product object

  Usage (inside a product form):
  {% render 'product-notice-property', product_obj: product %}
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign notice_text = product_obj.metafields.custom.product_badge_1.value -%}
{%- if notice_text != blank -%}
  <input type="hidden" name="properties[Notice]" value="{{ notice_text | escape }}">
{%- endif -%}
